        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0453" n="335" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00 Nanking/249: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-01T20:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 1, 1928—8
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 1—10:50
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Fourth paragraph of my March 31, 8 p.m.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>According to word received from Huang Fu, Chiang Kai-shek has departed
                        from Nanking for the Northern front, and in his absence he has not found it
                        possible to have the desired arrangements made <pb facs="0454" n="336"
                            xml:id="pg336"/> for my proposed visit to Nanking. I am compelled,
                        therefore, with much regret, to forego that visit. I am returning to Peking,
                        sailing on the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Marblehead</hi> this
                        afternoon for Taku.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Exchange of the originals of documents signed March 30 will be arranged by
                        me before leaving, the exchange to be made through Cunningham.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>This cable communicated to Legation.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
